        "step_number": 7,
        "text": "Step 7: Substitute \\(W = \\frac{200}{\\pi}\\) back into the equation for \\(L\\): \\(L = 200 - \\frac{\\pi \\cdot \\frac{200}{\\pi}}{2} = 200 - 100 = 100\\)."
